{"id":"chutok","lemma":"чуток","pos":"adv","rank":3330,"glosses":["a little, a bit"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9f/Ru-%D1%87%D1%83%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BA.ogg/Ru-%D1%87%D1%83%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BA.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Думаю, мне нужно ещё чуток времени.","en":"I think I need a little more time.","words":[{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"it is necessary"},{"g":"still / more"},null,{"g":"time","l":"время"}]},{"text":"Мне надо чуток поспать.","en":"I need to sleep a little.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"must, necessary"},null,{"g":"to sleep"}]},{"text":"Как насчёт добавить чуток перца?","en":"How about adding a touch of pepper?","words":[{"g":"how / like"},{"g":"about"},{"g":"to add"},null,{"g":"pepper","l":"перец"}]},{"text":"Иногда здорово провести чуток времени наедине с собой.","en":"Sometimes it's great to spend some time alone.","words":[{"g":"sometimes, at times"},{"g":"great"},{"g":"to lead"},null,{"g":"time","l":"время"},{"g":"tête-à-tête, privately"},{"g":"with / from"},null]}]}